# Auction Request Flow
# Render: d2 docs/diagrams/auction-flow.d2 docs/diagrams/auction-flow.svg

direction: right

browser: Browser {shape: person}
ssp: SSP :8084
exchange: Exchange :8081
dsp_int: DSP Internal :8082
dsp_c1: DSP Competitor1 :8089
dsp_c2: DSP Competitor2 :8090
adserver: Ad Server :8085
tracker: Tracker :8083
nats: NATS {shape: queue}
reporting: Reporting :8086

# Flow
browser -> ssp: 1. Ad tag requests ad
ssp -> exchange: 2. OpenRTB bid request

exchange -> dsp_int: 3a. Fan-out (parallel)
exchange -> dsp_c1: 3b. Fan-out (parallel)
exchange -> dsp_c2: 3c. Fan-out (parallel)

dsp_int -> exchange: 4a. Bid 2.50 CPM (video/audio: VAST 4.2 in adm, protocol 13)
dsp_c1 -> exchange: 4b. Bid 4.73 CPM
dsp_c2 -> exchange: 4c. Bid 5.50 CPM

# Winner assembly: the exchange substitutes the OpenRTB §4.4 auction macros
# (${AUCTION_PRICE} = clearing price, ${AUCTION_ID}, ${AUCTION_CURRENCY})
# into the winner's adm; the SSP forwards adm gated on the imp's advertised
# protocols; the publisher-adserver serves the buyer's VAST with platform-
# signed trackers injected (MediaURL ext = fallback when adm is absent).
exchange -> adserver: 5. Winner - serve creative
adserver -> browser: 6. HTML + pixel URLs (macros substituted)

browser -> tracker: 7. Impression pixel (1x1 GIF)
browser -> tracker: 8. Viewability beacon (204)

tracker -> nats: 9. Publish events
exchange -> nats: 10. Publish auction.win + auction.complete

nats -> reporting: 11. Consume - analytics + billing

exchange -> dsp_int: 12a. Loss notification
exchange -> dsp_c1: 12b. Loss notification
exchange -> dsp_c2: 12c. Win notification
